    given-names: Daniel Agyekum
    email: janetobosuayaa@gmail.com
title: "Ghana FX Value-at-Risk: Illustrative vs. Real-Data Calibration"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
url: "https://github.com/DanielAgyekumAmakyeGh/ghana-fx-var"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A dual-calibration FX VaR analysis comparing a fictional illustrative
  case with a real-data calibration on 10 years of Bank of Ghana USD/GHS
  reference rates. The parametric model fails the Kupiec backtest
  outright; GARCH(1,1) reveals IGARCH persistence and a 2.32x conditional
  VaR uplift. A daily risk report using historical simulation is provided
  as the primary measure.
keywords:
  - value-at-risk
  - market-risk
  - ghana
  - basel-iii
  - garch
  - kupiec-backtest
  - expected-shortfall